IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hota-transplants`

-- Human Organ Transplant Act 1987, ss 2, 4, 5, 11, 13, 15, 16, 17, 28 and the Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_human-organ-transplant-act-1987.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

