`a consenting adult who understands` MEANS Donor WITH
    `consented` IS TRUE
    `mentally disordered` IS FALSE
    `understands the procedure and its consequences` IS TRUE
    `consent given under a prohibited deal` IS FALSE
    `consent tainted by fraud, duress or undue influence` IS FALSE

