§ `s 2 and the Schedules`

#ASSERT `Part 2 reaches the organ` `a kidney`
#ASSERT `Part 2 reaches the organ` `a heart`
#ASSERT `Part 2 reaches the organ` `a cornea`
#ASSERT NOT `Part 2 reaches the organ` `a lung`

#ASSERT `the organ is a specified organ` `a kidney`
#ASSERT `the organ is a specified organ` `a liver or part of one`
#ASSERT NOT `the organ is a specified organ` `a heart`
#ASSERT NOT `the organ is a specified organ` `a cornea`

#ASSERT `the trading ban reaches the organ` `a lung`

§ `ss 4, 5`

#ASSERT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `an adult citizen who never objected`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `an adult who registered an objection`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a foreign tourist`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a 19-year-old without parental consent`
#ASSERT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a 19-year-old with parental consent`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `an adult believed mentally disordered`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a road death without the Coroner's consent`
#ASSERT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a road death with the Coroner's consent`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a kidney` `a citizen who died at home`
#ASSERT NOT `removal after death may be authorised` `a lung` `an adult citizen who never objected`

§ `s 11`

#ASSERT `has the priority of a non-objector` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `has the priority of a non-objector` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `has the priority of a non-objector` TRUE TRUE 1 FALSE
#ASSERT `has the priority of a non-objector` TRUE TRUE 2 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `has the priority of a non-objector` TRUE TRUE 3 TRUE

§ `s 13`

#ASSERT `the arrangement is void` `a cash price` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the arrangement is void` `a gift of property` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the arrangement is void` `reimbursement of travel, child care and lost earnings` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the arrangement is void` `medical care or insurance after donation` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the arrangement is void` `a Government donor benefits scheme` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the arrangement is void` `a reciprocal donation to the donor's chosen recipient` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the arrangement is void` `a reciprocal donation to the donor's chosen recipient` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the arrangement is void` `a cash price` FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a donor selling own organ` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a patient buying an organ for own transplant` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a buyer of an organ for someone else` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a middleman taking a fee` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a seller of another person's organ` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for trading` `a manager of an organ-brokering company` EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months for trading` `a donor selling own organ` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months for trading` `a middleman taking a fee` EQUALS 120

§ `ss 15, 16, 17`

#ASSERT `the living donor transplant is lawful` `a kidney` `an authorised hospital transplant`
#ASSERT NOT `the living donor transplant is lawful` `a kidney` `a transplant without committee authorisation`
#ASSERT NOT `the living donor transplant is lawful` `a kidney` `a transplant after the donor withdrew consent`
#ASSERT NOT `the living donor transplant is lawful` `a kidney` `a transplant during a suspension`
#ASSERT `the living donor transplant is lawful` `a kidney` `a transplant during a suspension allowed by the Director-General`

#ASSERT `the committee may authorise` `a consenting adult who understands`
#ASSERT `the committee may authorise` `a 16-year-old who understands and consents`
#ASSERT NOT `the committee may authorise` `a donor paid under the table`
#ASSERT NOT `the committee may authorise` `a donor pressured by family`
